    narr:narration """On 2026-08-11, DaveQuantum declared a database migration from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB for the analytics pipeline, framed as a decision already made rather than a proposal under consideration [switching to QuantumDB](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786440665269_1). The justification rests on two quantified claims — 10x query performance and lower licensing cost — stated as fact rather than projected or hedged [performance and cost justification](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786440665269_2). XenaExpertgh's editorial restatement consolidates the decision into bullet form, repeating the migration and the performance gain alongside a concrete Q3 2026 timeline [editorial restatement of migration](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786440665269_3), [performance gain bullet](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786440665269_4), [timeline commitment](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786440665269_5). The broader frame [adopts new technology stacks on quantified performance-and-cost grounds](narr:Narrative_TechnologyMigrationRationale), asking what commitment — timeline, scope — is attached to the move. All children share a single date and a single decision; no dissent, no alternative technology, no risk or migration-cost counterclaim appears in this hub.""" ;
